Maintainer: Jon <dvbondoy@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13),
               python3
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: flickos-kit-containers
Architecture: all
Depends: flickos-kit-base,
         podman,
         podman-docker,
         distrobox,
         uidmap,
         passt,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: FlickOS developer kit: Podman and Distrobox for containers
 Rootless containers: Podman (podman-docker makes the docker command
 work through it) and Distrobox. Nothing runs until a container is
 started: the kit keeps netavark's DHCP helper off until
 /etc/flickos/kits/netavark-on exists.
 .
 A kit is installed from Software's Developer Tools and removed there too.
 Nothing it installs runs until it is used (docs/design/flickos-dev.md).
